## Iron Rule: Identity Is Backend-Only

Vehicle identity resolution (make, model, variant, platform classification) is defined EXCLUSIVELY in:

1. `supabase/functions/_shared/taxonomy/normalizeVehicleIdentity.ts` — canonical normalizer
2. `supabase/functions/_shared/taxonomy/derivePlatform.ts` — platform classifier + badge extractor
3. `supabase/functions/_shared/taxonomy/parseSlug.ts` — MULTI_WORD_MODELS for slug parsing
4. DB taxonomy tables (`taxonomy_models`, `taxonomy_variant_rank`)
5. DB function `derive_platform_class(make, model)` — SQL mirror

