## Regression Test Harness

`supabase/functions/identity-regression-tests/index_test.ts` — 19 tests covering:
- Prado vs LandCruiser collision prevention
- SR vs SR5 badge isolation
- Word-boundary enforcement for short badges
- Platform class separation (Pajero Sport, Patrol)
- Badge priority (longer matches first)
- Null/empty handling

## Frontend Rule

Frontend may DISPLAY `vehicle.variant_family`, `vehicle.platform_class`, etc.
Frontend must NEVER derive, classify, or resolve identity.
